---
title: LiDAR Subsystem — Vehicle Detection and Classification
---
flowchart TD
    A[3D point cloud captured\nfrom LiDAR sensor] --> B[Preprocess:\ndownsample via voxel grid\nROI crop to gate zone]

    B --> C[Ground plane removal\nRANSAC or height threshold]
    C --> D[Cluster extraction\nEuclidean clustering\nor DBSCAN]

    D --> E{Cluster found\nin trigger zone?}
    E -- No --> F[Return: NO_VEHICLE\nconf=0.0]
    E -- Yes --> G[Extract cluster\nbounding box + centroid]

    G --> H[Feature extraction:\n- height, width, length\n- point density\n- silhouette profile\n- aspect ratios]

    H --> I{Classification method}
    I -- Neural --> J[PointNet-lite or\nfeature-based MLP\nTensorRT engine]
    I -- Heuristic --> K[Rule-based classifier:\ndimension thresholds\nfor car/SUV/truck]

    J --> L[Vehicle class +\nconfidence score]
    K --> L

    L --> M[Compute vehicle\nposition and velocity\nin gate coordinate frame]

    M --> N[Return:\nvehicle_class\n+ class_conf\n+ position\n+ velocity\n+ bounding_box]

    F --> O[Result to\nDecision Fusion]
    N --> O

    style J fill:#22c55e,color:#fff
    style K fill:#22c55e,color:#fff
    style N fill:#16a34a,color:#fff
    style F fill:#dc2626,color:#fff
